This package reproduces results reported in:
  "CAC Plus: Open-source engineering toolkit for opportunistic AI coronary calcium
   screening across multi-format chest CT pipelines", Radiology: Artificial Intelligence, 2026.

It wraps, unchanged, the VA AI-CAC algorithm of Hagopian et al.
(github.com/Raffi-Hagopian/AI-CAC, release v1.0.0, MIT License). No invention is claimed
over that algorithm, the Agatston scoring formula (Agatston et al. 1990), or nnU-Net.

No patient data or protected health information is included in this repository.
